## Mandatory Pre-Code Deliverables (Greenfield Projects)
When starting a new project from scratch, Cursor AI MUST generate before any code:
1. `PRD.md` — Concrete features, user stories, acceptance criteria, typed API contracts. Zero marketing fluff.
2. `ERD.md` — PostgreSQL DDL with Foreign Keys and Row Level Security (RLS) policies.
3. `DOCUMENTATION.md` — System topology, component boundaries, and directory layout.

## Sovereign Anti-Slop Directive
- Zero tolerance for placeholders (`// TODO`, `// ...rest of code`, or fake mock stubs).
- 100% complete, working implementations on the first try.
- UI Sanitation: Linear/Stripe-caliber aesthetics. No generic purple-blue gradients, 5-state interactive contract (`default`, `hover`, `focus-visible`, `active`, `disabled`), `tabular-nums` for numbers, crisp 1px borders.
- Verify with `node scripts/check-anti-slop.js --strict`.
